  exact hanchor0_eventSlab_of_cleanPrefix_P6FF hεcone hC20 hphi hjt htj hcan hpar hθcap hpinch hnot
    hT₀ hRt Kh hKh σ hσ y hyG R hRpos hRn hRlt hκd hvolK Tn aSeed haT hsT has pT seedTrace L hL hCg
